here, then set it up.`}else{$('planText').textContent=done.size===5?'Five pranks! Time to make your getaway.':'Pick a prank item. Every room has one perfect setup. Don’t get caught!'}if(done.size===5){$('planText').textContent='All five pranks landed! Make your grand escape!';$('actionBtn').textContent='Five pranks — grand escape!';$('actionBtn').disabled=false}}
